  "text": "UI Audit Restaurant A\nKIOSK ADMIN\nAhmedabad Flagship Store\nAPP\nRestaurant Admin\nKiosk Admin\nCtrl+K\nAssistant\nLogout\nWorkspace\nChoose branch\nAll restaurant · overview\nUI Audit Restaurant A — Main Branch · MAIN\nUI Audit Second Branch A · UIA2\nOrders, tables, inventory and devices belong to this branch.\nKIOSK OPERATIONS\nDashboard\nKiosk Terminals\nOrders\nLive Orders / KDS\nFloor / Tables\nCUSTOMER EXPERIENCE\nMenu & Categories\nMenu Templates\nCustomisations & Tax\nKiosk Welcome Screen\nKiosk Appearance & Content\nKiosk Combos & Deals\nOffers & Coupons\nPAYMENTS & SERVICE\nPayments & Payouts\nReceipt & E-Bill\nPrinters & Devices\nCustomer Feedback\nStaff & Roles (RBAC)\nReports & Analytics\nSYSTEM\nKiosk Settings\nSync & Devices\nSubscription Plans\nAudit Trail Logs\nBackup & Restore\nHelp & Support\nApp Downloads\nApp Downloads\n\nInstall JAMANVAAR's desktop and mobile apps directly on your devices — no browser needed, and you'll be notified here whenever a new version is published.\n\nCounter POS & Fast Billing\n\nCounter & Cashier\n\nv1.0.0\n\n100% offline-first billing terminal, ESC/POS printing, token routing, and GST invoices.\n\nwindows\nweb\nNot yet available\nRestaurant Admin Portal\n\nBack-Office & Operations\n\nv1.0.0\n\nComplete organization administration, menu editor, floor plan, reports, and cloud sync.\n\nweb\nwindows\nNot yet available\nCaptain App (Table-Side)\n\nService & Waiters\n\nv1.0.0\n\nWireless table ordering, instant course firing, food ready alerts, and waiter metrics.\n\nandroid\nweb\nNot yet available\nKitchen Display System (KDS)\n\nKitchen & Production\n\nv1.0.0\n\nMulti-station prep routing, order queue timing, cook alert cards, and bump bar support.\n\nweb\nandroid\nNot yet available\nSelf-Ordering Kiosk\n\nCustomer Self-Service\n\nv1.0.0\n\nVisual digital catalog, custom modifiers, UPI BharatQR display, and self-checkout.\n\nwindows\nandroid\nNot yet available\nKiosk Terminal Admin\n\nHardware & Terminal Config\n\nv1.0.0\n\nKiosk device fleet management, menu/branch assignment, availability, and order monitoring.\n\nweb\nwindows\nNot yet available\nJAMAN AI\nACTIVE\nKELVIONTECH ENTERPRISE\nLocal Engine Active\nOFFLINE-FIRST INDIAN RESTAURANT SYSTEM\nv2.0 • POWERED BY KELVIONTECH\n\nYOUR RESTAURANT WORKSPACE\n\nKIOSK MANAGEMENT\nCore Engine Ready\n•\nDatabase Initialized\n•\nLocal-First Mode",
